{"id":"hzip.1","n":"hzip","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"hunspell-devel","ver":"1.7.0-11.el9","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/h/hunspell-devel-1.7.0-11.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/hzip.1.gz","sha256":"2f5a70da8d774c2e867692584703ae338593f78046365a2980177f3a9c2338dc","date":"2008-06-12","origin":""},"u":{"pkg":"hunspell-tools","ver":"1.7.0-4build1","repo":"jammy/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/h/hunspell/hunspell-tools_1.7.0-4build1_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/hzip.1.gz","sha256":"9b4da23f1bb277d44b0b7aa67947573af5420b878f1e5b69477add7a35661441","date":"2008-06-12","origin":""}},"nopt":{"r":2,"u":2},"desc":"compress and encrypt dictionary files","same":true,"doc":[["NAME","<p>hunzip - compress and encrypt dictionary files</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p>hzip [-h] [-P password] [file(s)]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><i>hunzip</i> is a small utility for text file compression and encryption, especially for sorted dictionaries. \"hunspell filename\" creates the compressed file \"filename.hz\" without removing the original file.</p> <p>The compression algorithm uses 16-bit Huffman encoding and line-oriented prefix-suffix compression. It has good compression ratio for huge sorted word lists.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-h</b></dt><dd>Display short help description.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-P password</b></dt><dd>Encrypted compression by an arbitrary length password.</dd></dl>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>hzip (1), hunspell(1)</b></p>"],["AUTHOR","<p>László Németh.</p>"]]}